#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:106
msgid "A vector layer has its own hierarchy of shapes, also named *z-Order*."
msgstr "矢量图层在绘制形状时存在上下顺序，这有时候会被称作“Z 顺序 (z-order)”。"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:108
msgid ""
"When a Vector Layer is rendered, shapes are drawn from the bottom to the top:"
msgstr "矢量图层在绘制时是从下到上绘制形状的，上面的形状会遮挡下面的形状："

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:113
msgid "*z-Order* Visualization of shapes"
msgstr "矢量形状在绘制时的逻辑顺序"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:113
msgid "Rendered image from shapes"
msgstr "矢量形状的实际绘制效果"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:117
msgid "The *z-Order* of shapes can be modified in 2 way:"
msgstr "矢量形状的上下顺序可以使用两种方式调整："

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:119
msgid "From :ref:`Docker Arrange <arrange_docker>`"
msgstr "使用 :ref:`矢量图形排列控制面板 <arrange_docker>`"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:120
msgid "From context menu, accessible with |mouseright|"
msgstr "使用矢量工具的 |mouseright| 右键菜单"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:122
msgid "Both provides the same functions:"
msgstr "这两种方式都提供了同样的操作："

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:124
msgid "|icon_arrange_front| Bring to Front: move *z-Order* position to the top"
msgstr "|icon_arrange_front| 置于最上方：移动到绘制顺序最上方"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:125
msgid "|icon_arrange_raise| Raise: move *z-Order* position on step up"
msgstr "|icon_arrange_raise| 上升：在绘制顺序中上移一级"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:126
msgid "|icon_arrange_lower| Lower: move *z-Order* position on step down"
msgstr "|icon_arrange_lower| 下降：在绘制顺序中下移一级"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:127
msgid "|icon_arrange_back| Send to Back: move *z-Order* position to the bottom"
msgstr "|icon_arrange_back| 置于最下方：移动到绘制顺序最下方"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:132
msgid "Red square has been \"Bring to front\""
msgstr "红色方块已“置于最上方”"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:137
msgid "Selecting Shapes"
msgstr "选择形状"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:139
msgid ""
"To manipulate shapes, you need to select them with the :ref:"
"`shape_selection_tool` |toolshapeselection|."
msgstr ""
"要操作矢量形状，您首先要使用 |toolshapeselection| :ref:"
"`shape_selection_tool` 选中它们。"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:141
msgid ""
"The :ref:`shape_selection_tool` also provides access to options to manage "
"shape geometry, stroke and fill properties."
msgstr ""
":ref:`shape_selection_tool` 还提供了用于控制形状的几何、填充、描边等属性的选"
"项。"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:146
msgid "Editing Shapes Outline"
msgstr "编辑形状轮廓"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:148
msgid ""
"Outline for a shape can be edited with the :ref:`shape_edit_tool` |"
"toolshapeedit|."
msgstr ""
"矢量形状的轮廓锚点可以使用 |toolshapeedit| :ref:`shape_edit_tool` 进行编辑。"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:153
msgid "Rendering Vector Layer content"
msgstr "矢量图层的画布显示"

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/vector_layers.rst:155
msgid ""
"By default, vector layer content are rendered using an anti-aliasing "
"algorithm."
msgstr "默认情况下，矢量图层在绘制时会使用抗锯齿算法进行平滑处理。"
